{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1b041eb21d9fa4c9e227c8543341d25682d7c4582e612e213ddff0145700ecce", "ja": "（海のステージでのライブ後……このみさんと\n話していたら、いつの間にか日が落ちてしまった）", "zh": "（海边舞台的演唱会结束之后……我和木实在聊天，\n不知不觉间太阳已经下山了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "e2f4fd2b6d7be77f455e8e743d408cf6bdf8aea3b03030c009af42c7b4d26f57", "ja": "あら、いつの間にかこんな時間……。\nもうすっかり暗くなっちゃったわね。", "zh": "哎呀，居然这么晚了……\n天色都暗下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "26c95e72c09b300358f328ace0c9af2192a4f68ea44de98d187152010b1c6538", "ja": "{$P$}とおしゃべりするのが\n楽しくて、つい時間を忘れちゃったわ♪", "zh": "和{$P$}聊天实在太快乐，\n一不小心就忘了时间呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ee67cbc66921ff838c06375b9dcffbf6a25df80db43945894c0606d8261f859b", "ja": "結構、話しこんじゃったみたいですね。\nこのみさん、体、冷えてませんか？", "zh": "我们好像聊了很久呢。\n木实，你会不会冷？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "3fce520bdebada3b8792ea8a1c5887e070b220f6cbabd24ce7ade8e3e682b27f", "ja": "大丈夫よ。ありがとう、{$P$}。\nウフフ、優しいのね！", "zh": "不用担心，谢谢你，{$P$}。\n呵呵，你真体贴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "49604bc4863d063e20dbc1d846bca2413a7865e20da23efbe8b8f88ebd8960d2", "ja": "でも、そうね。そろそろ帰りましょうか。\nみんなが心配してるといけないし……。", "zh": "不过，我们也差不多该回去了。\n总不能让大家担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "f3f726a92a79bad16cd5a87f285523ffe6aa3b80a5339f7712f3f8faa38c8e1f", "ja": "{$P$}、今日はお姉さんのセクシーな\n水着姿をたっぷり堪能して満足した？なんて……。", "zh": "{$P$}，今天看了这么多姊姊\n穿泳装的性感美姿，有没有心满意足呀？我说笑的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1007_p", "source_sha256": "41416867f4e7d2e440a0afb64df781aee25ea8991dfe18520b9a9b6b9f675fae", "ja": "そうですね。今日はこのみさんの魅力を、\n改めていろいろ感じられたし、発見できましたよ。", "zh": "说得也是，我今天再次领会到了\n木实充满魅力的一面，有不少新发现喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "b37edeb29edcc294aa084096c8ff18702988da17816e86b279bc499e27d4e1aa", "ja": "あ、あら？　冗談のつもりだったんだけど……\nでも、そんなふうに言ってもらえるのはうれしいわね♪", "zh": "哎、哎呀？我只是说笑而已……\n不过，我很高兴能听你这么说♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "b081aa0d9226bfe3f6916a59e583d807975e823dc5663dea7430b1a5025990d4", "ja": "それに、久しぶりに{$P$}と\nたくさん話ができて楽しかったわ。", "zh": "而且，好久没和{$P$}\n说上这么多话了，真是开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1010_p", "source_sha256": "57518588f7eca05ca3491da2012033ae92b1ae969f1ee61555a05b6947f12f2e", "ja": "そうですね。仕事では、いつも一緒ですけど……\nこうして落ち着いて話をしたのは久しぶりですね。", "zh": "对呀，工作方面虽然常常在一块……\n但确实很久没有像现在这样悠闲聊天了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ee86cd718b10eca6c47c83eeeb74a84a6af4f9e24cf97505708f41d7ce9a5caa", "ja": "それじゃ、そろそろ戻りましょうか。\n帰りがあまり遅くなると、危ないですしね。", "zh": "那么，我们也是时候回去了。\n回家时间要是太晚也危险。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "a09c75a674474dfb7d258838a8954c65a8276e58f641216e3a5e1ef3966664c7", "ja": "……ちょっと、{$P$}？\n私のこと、子ども扱いしてるの？", "zh": "……喂，{$P$}，\n你是把我当成小孩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8f56c74dfb6e45c0ac01ccd9e2cdbb4222aeb6c7ac117e1a8086cb9360b7ef41", "ja": "違いますよ。夜、女性を出歩かせるのは\n危ないというだけで……。", "zh": "不是啦，我只是觉得女性\n晚上在外面容易遇到危险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a2fec3d9e192b0320426ca459a06a1e017d9981675c46d79d1b68aeadf772b83", "ja": "だいたい、このみさんは\n劇場の大切なアイドルなんですから。", "zh": "而且木实\n可是我们剧场的宝贝偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "7e2f525caa403b8ae82599595419ef4e0f87a55ee2f3c72a322c4c82be82137e", "ja": "あ……、そうだったのね、ごめんなさい。\n私ったら、勘違いしちゃって……。", "zh": "啊……原来是这样，对不起。\n我真是的，误会你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "7d117b12fdf984a262813a28bb87034fced5079701350a93f0d66dfec57f9156", "ja": "劇場の大切なアイドル……。そっか、そうよね。\nなんだかうれしいわ、ウフフ♪", "zh": "剧场的宝贝偶像……这样啊，说得也是。\n感觉有点开心呢，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "e22b0b90da09d2251009e743965201b0198016c96de72987d5d4549569c0def4", "ja": "じゃあ、行きましょうか！　{$P$}に\nしっかり守ってもらって……。", "zh": "那我们走吧！\n{$P$}要好好护送我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1018_se", "source_sha256": "2ac3748705623a7b06bf6cc26a0f377a0d517d35ecbe2440c67d0e141df7bd51", "ja": "ヒュゥーーー", "zh": "咻────", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "f3245a71c7131e58e119cccd446f966a214c0ead832f9b5e9b2fff0d121a3982", "ja": "……っくちゅん！", "zh": "……哈啾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1020_p", "source_sha256": "69e53b32f36799b355c04169dda4ab2ed1e82de341a43ef1be6fa3dada26ef11", "ja": "だ、大丈夫ですか、このみさん？", "zh": "还、还好吗？木实？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "47198535da7b7790553bc003f80a91011aa5e64040f63c7d57034eac98be9686", "ja": "あはは……やっぱり、少し冷えちゃったかしら？\n帰りましょう、{$P$}。", "zh": "啊哈哈……天气好像真的有点凉了，\n我们回去吧，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1022_p", "source_sha256": "54f747f7c1f792c8940469218d259dc319de8de4221a696839f826266136b6c1", "ja": "そうですね。すみません、\n防寒着が俺の上着しかありませんけど……。", "zh": "对呀。\n不好意思，能防寒的只有我的上衣而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "c96bbfd20d615a1651e7db6104f38f36cee1ed8fa15a9b06de2c38b7ea2bf7a6", "ja": "ありがとう。\nでも気を遣わなくていいのよ？", "zh": "谢谢你，\n但你不用这么担心我喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0074_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "0093b5032383e26e0292183449f9fca094a7873195b980f917a1868d2d9d3f34", "ja": "それに、{$P$}の上着じゃ\nサイズが……なんでもないわ。こっちを見ないの！", "zh": "再说，以{$P$}的上衣尺寸，\n我穿会……没事，不准看这边！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
